{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Google 多項服務今天早上出現故障，身處歐盟或英國的用戶可能無法正常上網。</p>\n<h2>DNS 雲端及廣告服務受影響</h2>\n<p>故障涵蓋 DNS、雲端及廣告投放，Google 各項服務均出現問題，美國則未受影響。</p>\n<img alt=\"與 Google 相關的圖片\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/google-scaled.jpeg\">\n<img alt=\"Screenshot 2026 10 20 11.07.17\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Screenshot-2026-10-20-11.07.17-1024x943.jpg\">\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T12:04:03.553144+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":97,"images":2,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T11:24:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T05:57:39.366676+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T11:57:46.762780+00:00","content_hash":"b8080e26b627261051a075531a8ef3ead223da881beaf98e386b081b8c5fc8ee","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}